type: software
title: "RiskMap: Geostatistical Modeling of Spatially Referenced Data"
version: 2.0.0
abstract: >-
  Geostatistical analysis of continuous and count data. Implements
  stationary Gaussian processes with Matern correlation for spatial
  prediction, as described in Diggle and Giorgi (2019, ISBN:
  978-1-138-06102-7).
